  {
    "id": "c013",
    "name": "1.1 Scope of Services — Other Tasks",
    "text": "Other Tasks, Perform other communications tasks as agreed upon by the client."
  },
  {
    "id": "c014",
    "name": "1.2 Additional Services",
    "text": "1.2 Additional Services. Additional services such as public affairs carnpalgns required by the client that fall outside the boundarles of the Scope of Services herein with client approval wlll be charged at Xenophon’s then-currently hourly rates."
