  {
    "id": "c018",
    "name": "3.2 Substitution",
    "text": "3,2 Substitution, The Client understands and agrees that Xenophon may substitute another similarly quallfled staff member to perform the Services, The Cllent also understands and agrees that Xenophon may, from time to tlme and at Its discretion, augment the above-referenced staff, as needed, to perform the agreed-upon Services."
