    "id": "c019",
    "name": "3.3 Offers of Employment",
    "text": "3,3 Offers of Employment. Both Partles agree not to make offers of employment to any of the other Party’s employees during or for a perlad of one year following the conclusion of this Agreement. This provision Includes any Individuals then-currently employed by the applicable Party during the term of the Agreement elther directly or through a third party. The Partles agree that violation of this provision will result in damages equal to one year of the employee's gross salary,"
