    "name": "4.2(c) Third-party Expenses",
    "text": "(c) The Client agrees and understands that Xenophon Is entitled to relmbursement for Third-party Expenses and agrees to pay Xenophon the cost of Third-party Expenses upon recelpt, Third-party Expenses shall include, without limitation, the cost of conference calls, subscriptions to specialty publications, external supplier services for media distribution, graphic design, website construction, advertlsing placement, video production, printed materials, third-party spokesperson fees, meeting factlltles and related food, beverage, and audio visual equipment and other vendor and/or subcontractor charges, or others,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "4.2 Third-party Expense Approval and Markup",
    "text": "Xenophon agrees and understands that all Third-party Expenses of $1,000 or more must receive priot approval from the Client, All third party expenses will be billed along with an Industry standard mark up of 17,65%, excluding travel related expenses which shall be billed at cost."
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "5.1 Monthly Invoices",
    "text": "Article 5 — Client Invoices 5,1 Monthly Invoices. Xenophon shall provide the client with monthly invoices detalllng Its fees and expenses."
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "5.1(a) Services Invoices",
    "text": "(a) For Services, the Client will be Invoiced for Services on a monthly basis, along with the six percent professlonal fee outlined In section 4.2 (a) (“Out-of-Pocket Expenses”), Involces will be sent on or about the 1° of each month and payment is due upon recelpt, The first Involce of this contract will be delivered on or about November 1, 2014 for work performed In October, 2014. A detalled summary of billable time will be provided to the cllent the following month, after It Is Incurred."
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "5.1(b) Travel and Third-party Expense Invoices",
    "text": "(b) For Travel and Third-party expenses, the Client will be Involced after costs are Incurred, Payment Is due upon receipt. The first Expense Invoice will be dellvered on or about December 1, 2014,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "5.2 Late Payments",
    "text": "5,2 Late Payments, Xenophon reserves the right to Impose an interest charge equal to Its own borrowing rate for any Involce payment outstanding more than 30 days. Xenophon may also stop work on Clent accounts that are overdue. In the avent Xenophon must suspend work because of the Cilent’s fallure to pay Its Monthly Invoices In a tlmely fashion, Xenophon shall have no llabllity to the Cllent for delay or damage caused because of such suspension of work."
  },
  {
    "id": "c030",
    "name": "6.1 Modification or Stopping of Work",
    "text": "Article 6 — Modification or Stopping of Work 6.1 Modification or Stopping of Work, The Client shall have the right to modify or stop any schedules or work {In progress under this agreement; and In such event, Xenophon shall Immediately take proper steps to carry out such Instructions. However, In any such case, Client, agrees (|) to assume Xenophon’s liability for commitments made to thirdparty vendors In respect of such work; (Il) to pay Xenophon In accordance with the terms and provisions of thls Agreement and (Ifl) to Indemnify Xenophon for all claims and actlonis by third partles for damages In corisequence of Xenophon’s carrying out the Client's instructions,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c031",
    "name": "7.1 General Indemnification",
    "text": "Article 7 ~- General Provisions 7.1 General Indemnification. The Client will Indemnity Xenophon against any loss or expense which Xenophon may Incur as the result of any clalm, sult or proceeding made or brought against Xenophon, or In which Xenophon Is asked to participate, based upon Information provided or approved by the Cllent prior to Its dissemination, production or publication, as well as any clalm or sult brought agalnst Xenophon as a result of its following the Instructlons of the Client, except for any loss or expense arising out of, elther directly or Indirectly, Xenophon’s negligent acts or omissions. The obligations of this paragraph will survive the expiration of thls Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c032",
    "name": "7.2 Confidentiality",
    "text": "7.2 Confidentiality, Xenophon shall use Its best efforts to safeguard the confidentiality of all proprietary and other confidential {information and materlals provided by the Cllent and to avold any dissernination of any such Information or materlals without the Client's explicit prior approval."
  },
  {
    "id": "c033",
    "name": "7.3 Performance of Subcontractors and Suppliers",
    "text": "7,3. Performance of Subcontractors and Suppliers, Xenophon will endeavor, to the best of Its ability, to guard agalnst any loss to the Cllant through the fallure of subcontractors and suppllers to execute properly thelr commitments, but Xenophon shall not be held responsible for any such fallure on the part of such subcontractors or suppllers."
  },
  {
    "id": "c034",
    "name": "7.4 Governing Law and Attorney’s Fees",
    "text": "7,4 Governing Law and Attorney’s Fees. This Agreement shall be governed by and construed In accordance with the laws of the District of Columbla, but excluding the conflict of laws rules thereof. In any dispute between the parties concerning any alleged breach of this Agreement, the prevailing party shall be entitled to receive its reasonable attorney's fees and expenses,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c035",
    "name": "7.5 Assignment",
    "text": "7.5 Assignment. Nelther Party may assign any of Its rights or delegate any of Its dutles or obligations under thls Agreement without the express written consent of the other Party,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c036",
    "name": "7.6 Partial Invalidity",
    "text": "7.6 Partlal Invalldity. In the event that any provision of this Agreement shall be construed to be Illegal or Invalld for any reason, sald legality or invalidity shall not affect the remaining provisions hereof, but such illegal or Invalid provision shall be fully severable and this Agreement shall be construed and enforced as If such Illegal and Invalid provision had never been Included hereln,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c037",
    "name": "7.7 Ownership",
    "text": "7.7 Ownership. Xenophon acknowledges and agrees that any materlals developed or created on behalf of the Client or a related entity In connection with the Services (a \"Dellverable\") are belng created and developed as a Work Made for Hire as defined by U.S. copyright laws and are owned by the Cllent. However, Xenophon may make routine use of the final work product developed pursuant to this Agreement as templates or exemplars, provided that any materlals provided to third parties that are based upon such final work product cannot be Identifled as relating to the Client. Xenophon will own copyright, title, and Interest In the methodologies used by Xenophon to develop the final work product produced pursuant to thls contract, as well as any drafts or other non-final work product, Xenophon agrees not to publish any drafts or other non-final work product if such publication can be Identifled as relating to the Client."
  },
  {
    "id": "c038",
    "name": "7.8 Entire Agreement",
    "text": "7.8 Entira Agreement. This Agreement constitutes the entire agreement between the Partlas with respect to the subject matter hereof, and supersedes any prior discussions, negotiations, or agreements with respact to the subject matter hereof, It may be changed only by a written agreement signed by the Parties,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c039",
    "name": "7.9 Notice",
    "text": "7,9 Notice, Alf notices hereunder shall be In writing and shall be deemed dellvered Upon personal delivery, delivery by Federal Express or another national recognized express delivery service, recelpt requested, or three (3) days after deposit In the U.S, mall, first class postage prepaid, certified, return recelpt requested, addressed as follows or as Indicated by written notice of change of address: Client: Jernigan, Copaland & Anderson, PLLC 587 Highland Colony Parkway Ridgeland, MS 39158-2598 Xenophon: Xenophon Strategles, Inc, Attn: Contract AdminIstration 1901 LST NW - Sulte 300 Washington, DC 20036"
  }
